Shpz88dSWAxVmmK8BHcSKLX0Q3IcHCE8oCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["小高拉麵連城店是連鎖分店，進店前先在門口的點餐機完成點餐，再依序於門口等候入場。麵條軟硬、湯頭濃淡及份量都可以客製化，操作方式清楚，不熟悉的人稍微看一下也能完成。這次點了醬油豚骨拉麵和麻辣豚骨拉麵，醬油口味較溫和順口，麻辣口味則多了香辣感，但不會只剩下辣味。叉燒、筍乾、蔥花和滷蛋等配料搭配起來很完整，麵條口感也可以依個人喜好調整。價格約135至145元，以目前物價來說算相當實惠，而且還可以免費加麵、無限續麵，食量較大的人會覺得很划算。店內環境簡單乾淨，座位不算寬敞，但翻桌速度快。以這個價位、份量和口味來說，確實沒有太多好挑剔，是一次還可以的用餐體驗。",null,[0,278]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVWxSRmNISk9SV1JyVjI1c2JWRlZhREpsV0ZwU1lteFNOVll6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVWxSRmNISk9SV1JyVjI1c2JWRlZhREpsV0ZwU1lteFNOVll6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVWxSRmNISk9SV1JyVjI1c2JWRlZhREpsV0ZwU1lteFNOVll6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVWxSRmNISk9SV1JyVjI1c2JWRlZhREpsV0ZwU1lteFNOVll6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVWxSRmNISk9SV1JyVjI1c2JWRlZhREpsV0ZwU1lteFNOVll6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVWxSRmNISk9SV1JyVjI1c2JWRlZhREpsV0ZwU1lteFNOVll6WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2042,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WUlRFcHJORWRrV25sbVFVaDJlWFpSYmxSNVYzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf7dd0f0d8a8473a7!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmVRTEprNEdkWnlmQUh2eXZRblR5V3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WUlRFcHJORWRrV25sbVFVaDJlWFpSYmxSNVYzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0